abstract: >-
  1,220 runs of the social-harness benchmark of Chugh et al. (arXiv:2609.17527), rerun with bia agents
  launched as persons in four arms that vary the society around the agents (away, persons, handbook,
  full circle), with the graders, the owner-aware judgements, the harness and a static explorer.
